      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِخْتِيَارِىٌّ</span></b>  [<i>Of,</i> or <i>relating to, the will,</i> or <i>choice</i>].
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِفَةٌ ٱخْتِيَارِيَّةٌ</span> [meaning <i>A quality which originates
from,</i> or <i>depends upon, the will,</i> or <i>choice,</i> i. e.
<i>an acquired quality,</i>] is opposed to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِلْقِيَّةٌ</span>. (Msb
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مدح</span>, &amp;c.)

